00:06:50.319 --> 00:06:54.729
whenever you wash any sort of plastic
base clothing like polyester and acrylic

00:06:54.729 --> 00:06:59.470
tiny fibers break off as your clothes
are bashing around inside the laundry

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:04.570
inside the washing machine and these
tiny fibers can't be filtered out by

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:09.669
your washing machine filter and so when
all the water washes through your

00:07:09.669 --> 00:07:15.849
clothes and washes off all the detergent
the water makes its way into the ocean

00:07:15.849 --> 00:07:21.970
carrying these tiny fibers along with
tires on your car and on trucks when you

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:26.949
break a lot just just with wear and tear
really the tires break down and tiny

00:07:26.949 --> 00:07:32.080
particles come off onto the road and
then blow away into the ocean or go down

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:35.800
the drain and eventually go into the
ocean now no one really knows exactly

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:41.530
what the extent of the impact of micro
plastics are but so far with studies it

00:07:41.530 --> 00:07:45.820
looks like it's not great for things
